					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13867436</guid>
				<title>SCP-5773</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13867436/scp-5773</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2020 15:24:48 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Cyvstvi13</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6004508</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: center;"> <blockquote> <p><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hPMnIymc3Cs">&quot;The Circle rules your life.&quot;</a></em></p> </blockquote> </div> <p>This started out as me wanting to explore how modern people are like ants and from there it turned into a full blown meta-commentary on society and the Foundation.</p> <p>TL;DR: We live in a society.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Here&nbsp;be&nbsp;spoilers</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Spoiled</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>The anomaly isn't just the pheromone. It's everything related to the Spiral. The essence of the spiral is cognitohazardous and spontaneous. There's no unknowable eldritch horror, no malicious Foundation secret, nothing that goes bump in the night and hides under your bed.</p> <p>It just exists because it does and those are the most horrifying things to me.</p> <p>The Foundation's pursuit of knowledge and answers, their insatiable desire to know everything is absolutely futile here. In fact, it is straight up detrimental to them because everything becomes a spiral, sooner or later.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p>Many thanks to the following critters:<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/marcelles-raynes" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5722579&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605799776" alt="Marcelles_Raynes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5722579)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/marcelles-raynes" >Marcelles_Raynes</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-moned" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5596963&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605799776" alt="Dr Moned" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5596963)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-moned" >Dr Moned</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anorrack" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4188420&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605799776" alt="Anorrack" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4188420)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anorrack" >Anorrack</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605799776" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakdragonx" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5588260&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605799776" alt="JakdragonX" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5588260)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakdragonx" >JakdragonX</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nagiros" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4665703&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605799776" alt="Nagiros" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4665703)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nagiros" >Nagiros</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/greyve" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4045981&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605799776" alt="Greyve" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4045981)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/greyve" >Greyve</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
