 href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyvstvi13" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6004508&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605751957" alt="Cyvstvi13" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6004508)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyvstvi13" >Cyvstvi13</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/marcelles-raynes" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5722579&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605751957" alt="Marcelles_Raynes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5722579)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/marcelles-raynes" >Marcelles_Raynes</a></span>, as well as a few others for whom I do not have wikidot names, for critique and advice.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Spoilers</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>I'm not going to spoil the plot; I either fixed it so it's more obvious, or I failed anyway. BUT, there is a sub-plot, and it involves a few key words in the document and the final cross-link at the end.</p> <p>&quot;Apaturinae,&quot; &quot;Cupido,&quot; &quot;geranial and neral,&quot; and &quot;Dr. K.&quot;</p> </div> </div> </div> 
