				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13863808</guid>
				<title>Repatriation</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13863808/repatriation</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2020 05:40:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Grigori Karpin</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4558017</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p><strong>Home again, home again. Jiggety-Jig.</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>So I have been thinking about this tale for almost a year. Rebekah once touched something she shouldn't have and paid for it with her mind, losing nearly a year to a psychotic break and a coma. When I first wrote <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4712">SCP-4712</a>, I didn't even know if Rebekah would be returning. She wasn't in my next two skips, after all. But once I started writing tales, I knew she was the one I'd most want to hear from.</p> <p>Anyway, thank you to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5903100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605505957" alt="Pedagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5903100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" >Pedagon</a></span> and as always, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harryblank" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6479803&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605505957" alt="HarryBlank" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6479803)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harryblank" >HarryBlank</a></span> for taking the time to read this and help me polish it out with their crit.</p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/hecatoncheires-cycle-hub">Hecatoncheires Cycle</a></strong></p> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
